{"4278420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tiny Survivors", "steam_appid": 4278420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your way through countless enemies. Survive longer, grow stronger, and stack powerful upgrades as you unleash chaos on wave after wave of relentless foes. How far can you push before the creatures of darkness push back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open chests, fight bosses, complete quests and grow stronger with each upgrade until nothing can stand in your way. Progress through various maps and difficulty tiers using permanent power-up upgrades and a bit (sometimes a lot) of luck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various weapons that scale with different stats to create totally not overpowered builds. Fight the progressively harder onslaught of creatures all while traversing the procedurally generated maps as fast as possible to collect upgrades to combat meeting your untimely end. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on a global leaderboard to see just how far your Tiny Survivor can push the weapon boundaries and break the game. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your way through countless enemies. Survive longer, grow stronger, and stack powerful upgrades as you unleash chaos on wave after wave of relentless foes. How far can you push before the creatures of darkness push back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open chests, fight bosses, complete quests and grow stronger with each upgrade until nothing can stand in your way. Progress through various maps and difficulty tiers using permanent power-up upgrades and a bit (sometimes a lot) of luck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various weapons that scale with different stats to create totally not overpowered builds. Fight the progressively harder onslaught of creatures all while traversing the procedurally generated maps as fast as possible to collect upgrades to combat meeting your untimely end. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on a global leaderboard to see just how far your Tiny Survivor can push the weapon boundaries and break the game. </p>", "short_description": "Fight through endless hordes of enemies in this action-packed roguelite. Collect powerful loot, level up, unlock new characters, and combine upgrades to create wild builds as you grow stronger with every run. How long can you survive the onslaught?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278420/0d58610eb481464c341b891ee8f88c578573f5e1/header.jpg?t=1788220347", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278420/c7e9e97e17219c9a97d0d2cfc3e99d9655f74861/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788220347", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278420/c7e9e97e17219c9a97d0d2cfc3e99d9655f74861/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788220347", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-8350 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU (Intel HD Graphics 530 or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Built with Unity. Designed to run on low-spec systems.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb